    "image_with_text_kYWHjF": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_JHxhH9": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Russ Tuff",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_aRVGTQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Russ Tuff is one of our dedicated WA instructors at Test & Training, consistently receiving positive feedback for his engaging courses and empowering others. </p><p>With over 18 years of experience across roles from restricted electrician in entertainment to safety manager in mining, Russ now runs his own successful test and tag business, working with major clients like Telstra and local schools in Perth.</p><p>Russ’s hands-on knowledge of electrical safety and testing regulations ensures his training is very hands-on and practical. His approachable style helps students of all levels feel confident and ready to succeed in the field.<br/><br/>If you're planning on doing our course in WA - Russ will be the trainer conducting the Test & Tag Training Course.<br/></p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
        "button_wEbk3k": {
          "type": "button",
