    "image_with_text_TywMYX": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_Jgwdyj": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Tracey Mills",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_7G6zCx": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Tracey is one of our top trainers at Test and Tag Training, bringing years of experience, skill, and passion to every session. Since joining us in April 2024, she has become known for her engaging and down-to-earth approach and ensuring every student is ready to test and tag.</p><p>With over 13 years of experience in delivering Work Health Safety (WHS) training and CPD (Continuous Professional Development) on behalf of key departments, Tracey’s knowledge runs deep. She’s worked across various Registered Training Organisations (RTOs)</p><p>Before joining our team, Tracey trained and assessed others in First Aid and CPR. She brings that same dedication to Test and Tag Training, going the extra mile to ensure every student has an enjoyable and valuable experience.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
